{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jwp6EQQQGo1793699294.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>本港上季經濟增長好過市場預期。</p><p></p><p>政府統計處公布，第三季本地生產總值按年增長百分之5.2，較上一季的百分之4.2增幅加快。</p><p></p><p>首三季合計，實質本地生產總值按年增長百分之5.1，是5年來同期最快的增長。政府發言人表示，展望香港經濟前景維持正面，全球人工智能投資強勁，應繼續支持本港商品出口，不過仍須密切留意地緣緊張局勢及多間主要央行，收緊貨幣政策的事態發展。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:42:08.712471+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:38:24.052028+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T10:38:31.664967+00:00","content_hash":"c9785cd94b910d4da8545f45667d98a657d874470369bd699c87b5dce0465892","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:42:08.712471+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}